                            </div>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__time">10:35 AM</span>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__avatar"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-inbox-row">
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__icon" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#feda77,#d6249f,#4f5bd5)">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <div class="pz-inbox-row__main">
                                <div class="pz-inbox-row__top">
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__name">Instagram</span>
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__pill">Instagram</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="pz-inbox-row__msg">Hey — saw your latest message</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__time">9:37 AM</span>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0b9d1,#d6249f)"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-inbox-row">
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__icon" style="background:var(--c-messenger)">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.2 2 11.3c0 2.9 1.4 5.5 3.6 7.2v3.5l3.3-1.8c.9.3 1.9.4 3.1.4 5.5 0 10-4.2 10-9.3S17.5 2 12 2z"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <div class="pz-inbox-row__main">
                                <div class="pz-inbox-row__top">
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__name">Facebook Messenger</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="pz-inbox-row__msg">Thank you for your message — moving to your...</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__time">8:33 AM</span>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#cfe1f7,#0084ff)"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-inbox-row">
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__icon" style="background:var(--c-telegram)">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M21.5 4.2 18.7 19c-.2 1-.8 1.2-1.6.8l-4.5-3.3-2.2 2.1.3-4.5 8.2-7.4-10.4 6.4-4.4-1.4 17.2-6.6c.8-.3 1.5.2 1.2 1.6z"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <div class="pz-inbox-row__main">
                                <div class="pz-inbox-row__top">
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__name">Telegram</span>
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__pill">Telegram</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="pz-inbox-row__msg">Hey! Your message has arrived — can I help you?</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__time">10:35 AM</span>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#cfe7f8,#229ed9)"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-inbox-row">
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__icon" style="background:var(--c-tiktok)">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19.5 8.5c-1.6 0-3-.6-4.1-1.6V15a5.5 5.5 0 1 1-5.5-5.5v2.8a2.8 2.8 0 1 0 2.8 2.7V3h2.7c.3 1.7 1.4 3 3.2 3.3v2.2z"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <div class="pz-inbox-row__main">
                                <div class="pz-inbox-row__top">
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__name">TikTok</span>
                                    <span class="pz-inbox-row__pill">TikTok</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="pz-inbox-row__msg">Hey! Your message — link to your bio</span>
                            </div>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__time">10:35 AM</span>
                            <span class="pz-inbox-row__avatar" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dcdcdc,#404040)"></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pz-tablet__contact">
                        <div class="pz-contact__head">
                            <div class="pz-contact__avatar"></div>
                            <div class="pz-contact__name">Jenna Smith</div>
                            <div class="pz-contact__role">Contact owner</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-contact__details">
                            <span>
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>
                                contact@home.com
                            </span>
                            <span>
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.86 19.86 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.86 19.86 0 0 1 2.12 4.18 2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.37 1.9.72 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.35 1.85.59 2.81.72A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
                                (555) 255-7563
                            </span>
                            <span>
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>
                                jenna@example.com
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-contact__section">
                            <div class="pz-contact__section-title">
                                <span>Activity</span>
                                <span>⌄</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pz-contact__activity">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
                                Last 5 post
                                <small>Answered 3 hours ago</small>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pz-contact__activity">
                                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 4 23 10 17 10"/><path d="M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10"/></svg>
                                Update 12 sounds
