                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="pz-step pz-reveal">
                <div class="pz-step__text">
                    <span class="pz-step__num">2</span>
                    <h3 class="pz-step__title">AI Agent reads, understands, replies in <strong>seconds</strong></h3>
                    <p class="pz-step__desc">Trained on your brand voice, product catalog, and FAQs — the agent answers like your best rep would.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pz-step__visual">
                    <span class="pz-ai-pill"><span class="pz-ai-dot"></span> AI is replying…</span>
                    <div class="pz-window">
                        <div class="pz-window__bar">
                            <span class="pz-window__dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
