                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-window__body">
                            <div class="pz-window__row is-active">
                                <span class="pz-avatar-xs is-ai">AI</span>
                                <div class="pz-window-meta">
                                    <span class="pz-window-name">"Yes — Tuesday 3 PM works. Shall I book it?"</span>
                                    <span class="pz-window-sub">Replied in 1.2s · context: catalog + calendar</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pz-window__row">
                                <span class="pz-avatar-xs">EM</span>
                                <div class="pz-window-meta">
                                    <span class="pz-window-name">Emma Müller</span>
                                    <span class="pz-window-sub">Yes please, 3 PM works for me</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="pz-step pz-reveal">
                <div class="pz-step__text">
                    <span class="pz-step__num">3</span>
                    <h3 class="pz-step__title">Lead automatically created with <strong>full context</strong></h3>
                    <p class="pz-step__desc">Contact, channel, intent, sentiment — every detail is captured and pushed to the right pipeline stage.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="pz-step__visual">
                    <div class="pz-window">
                        <div class="pz-window__bar">
                            <span class="pz-window__dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
                            <span class="pz-window__addr">app.chatcrm.io / pipeline / qualified</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="pz-window__body">
                            <div class="pz-window__row">
                                <span class="pz-avatar-xs">EM</span>
                                <div class="pz-window-meta">
                                    <span class="pz-window-name">Emma Müller</span>
